WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:43.450
Confirmation change and review. 12. Review and confirmation. The parties review whether the agreement matches work as performed. They examine unresolved decisions, avoidable rework, late uncommunicated changes, unowned tasks and the usability of cover. They do not use low incident-report numbers as proof that the arrangement is sound. Amendments are versioned, approved by the appropriate owner and communicated to affected people. The executive and EA confirm the agreement; finance, information-access and support-service owners confirm the parts that depend on their authority. No fictional signature is represented as a real approval.
